{"content":[{"c":["UZZA"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["1. Owner or initial planter of a garden that served as the burial place for kings Manasseh and Amon of Judah (",{"href":"?bref=2Kgs.21.18,26","r":"2Kgs.21.18,26","rawR":"2Kgs.21.18,26","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Kgs.21.18,26","value":"2Kgs.21.18,26"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Kgs 21:18, 26"},"). The “garden of Uzza” was apparently adjacent to Manasseh’s royal residence."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["2. KJV spelling for Uzzah, Shimei’s son, in ",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.6.29","r":"1Chr.6.29","rawR":"1Chr.6.29","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.6.29","value":"1Chr.6.29"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chronicles 6:29"},". ",{"c":["See"],"sourceClass":"ital","t":"span"}," ",{"href":"?item=Uzzah_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","id":"Uzzah_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","rawId":"Uzzah_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","t":"link","v":"Uzzah #2"},"."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["3. Son or descendant of Ehud from Benjamin’s tribe (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.8.7","r":"1Chr.8.7","rawR":"1Chr.8.7","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.8.7","value":"1Chr.8.7"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 8:7"},"), listed as an ancestor of Mordecai in extrabiblical texts."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["4. KJV spelling for Uzzah, Abinadab’s son, in ",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.13.7-11","r":"1Chr.13.7-11","rawR":"1Chr.13.7-11","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.13.7-11","value":"1Chr.13.7-11"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chronicles 13:7-11"},". ",{"c":["See"],"sourceClass":"ital","t":"span"}," ",{"href":"?item=Uzzah_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","id":"Uzzah_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","rawId":"Uzzah_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","t":"link","v":"Uzzah #1"},"."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["5. Forefather of a family of temple servants who returned to Jerusalem with Zerubbabel following the exile (",{"href":"?bref=Ezra.2.49","r":"Ezra.2.49","rawR":"Ezra.2.49","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ezra.2.49","value":"Ezra.2.49"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ezr 2:49"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Neh.7.51","r":"Neh.7.51","rawR":"Neh.7.51","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Neh.7.51","value":"Neh.7.51"}],"t":"ref","v":"Neh 7:51"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Uzza","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"2 Kgs 21:18, 26","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=2Kgs.21.18,26","rawQueryValue":"2Kgs.21.18,26","sourceRefExact":"2Kgs.21.18,26"},{"anchorText":"1 Chronicles 6:29","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.6.29","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.6.29","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.6.29"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 8:7","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.8.7","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.8.7","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.8.7"},{"anchorText":"1 Chronicles 13:7-11","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.13.7-11","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.13.7-11","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.13.7-11"},{"anchorText":"Ezr 2:49","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Ezra.2.49","rawQueryValue":"Ezra.2.49","sourceRefExact":"Ezra.2.49"},{"anchorText":"Neh 7:51","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Neh.7.51","rawQueryValue":"Neh.7.51","sourceRefExact":"Neh.7.51"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"6f794a804bc21628ff4629f6ff39c9a00f52b9157783e4730c29367189d4a5a9","sourceItemName":"Uzza","sourceItemOrder":37,"sourceMember":"Articles/U.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"Uzza","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Uzza","title":"Uzza","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}